  "title": "Geofencing, Dynamic Obstacles & Geospatial Data Architecture",
  "diagramType": "subsystem-architecture",
  "description": "Internal architecture of three COP engines: Geofence (eng-cop-geofence) for geofence definition, real-time evaluation, and alert generation; Dynamic Obstacles (eng-cop-dynamic-obstacles) for obstacle ingestion, tracking, and visualization; and Geospatial Data (eng-cop-geospatial-data) for data import/export, spatial indexing, and spatial query services. Shows integration with the COP Orchestrator, Vehicle State Store, Map Renderer, and Core Event Bus.",
